Package: divMetrics
Title: Computation and Visual Exploration of Diversity Indices
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Lukas", "Wallrich", , "l.wallrich@bbk.ac.uk", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides functions for calculating a range of diversity
    measures and for visualizing them. `divMetrics`
    enables users to explore divergences between diversity
    measures to pick one that matches their research questions.
